What is the **first** line this program prints?

```csharp
var actions = new List<Func<int>>();
for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) actions.Add(() => i);
Console.WriteLine(string.Join(",", actions.Select(a => a())));

var actions2 = new List<Func<int>>();
foreach (int j in new[] { 0, 1, 2 }) actions2.Add(() => j);
Console.WriteLine(string.Join(",", actions2.Select(a => a())));
```

What does this program print?

```csharp
string[] w = ["apple", "avocado", "banana", "blueberry", "cherry", "apricot"];
var biggest = w.GroupBy(x => x[0]).OrderByDescending(g => g.Count()).First();
Console.WriteLine($"{biggest.Key} {biggest.Count()}");
```

